 ("h2", "Which district of Nha Trang to choose?"),
 ("p", "Nha Trang is a diverse city."),
 ("p", "If you want to stay in five-star all-inclusive hotels with pools, beautiful grounds and good service, choose Cam Ranh."),
 ("p", "If you want to walk around the city, go out, visit bars and restaurants and try different food in different cafés, that's the Centre of Nha Trang."),
 ("p", "If you want quiet, calm and an unhurried life in a real Vietnamese district, choose the South."),
 ("p", "If you want complete seclusion, with almost no people around, that's An Vien."),
 ("p", "If you want to live close to the Russian-speaking community, buy familiar groceries and go to Russian cafés, choose the North."),
 ("p", "And if you come as a big family, with children, parents, dogs and cats, and plan to stay in Nha Trang for a long time, take a closer look at the West of the city."),
 ("p", "Nha Trang is different everywhere. And that is its main advantage: here you can choose not only a hotel or a flat, but also the way of life that suits you: be close to your own people in a familiar community / immerse yourself in purely Vietnamese life / or live secluded among greenery, enjoying the view of the azure sea every day."),
